0..71 Comment "//! `natural` compares a region-polymorphic function across a widening."
72..75 Comment "//!"
76..154 Comment "//! A view at an outer region stands at an inner region. The pathological twin"
155..216 Comment "//! refuses a reversed widening as `TypeMismatch`. It refuses"
217..241 Comment "//! unequal functions as"
242..265 Comment "//! `EndpointMismatch`."
266..340 Comment "//! Rust lets a `&\'long T` stand where a function expects a `&\'short T`. A"
341..410 Comment "//! function generic in its region cannot tell which one it receives."
411..414 Comment "//!"
415..492 Comment "//! The checker verifies each square by conversion. Both examples run to `5`."
493..496 Comment "//!"
497..556 Comment "//! - owes: #2139 — a value type that quantifies a region"
557..629 Comment "//! - see: corpus/pathological/regions/natural.gandr — invalid squares"
631..677 Comment "// `pass` returns a thunk in its input region."
